abstract: >-
  Research code and saved experimental results for a closed-form attention
  routing edit that reuses a successor-associated circuit in two Qwen3 models.
  The accompanying preprint reports causal controls, collateral effects,
  comparisons with gradient methods, and an LLM-guided primitive search.
